# Galvanic Giant: "Whenever you cast a spell" (CR 603.2) is only Bot1's own casts. Bot1 casts the Giant on turn 1 with a Black Lotus
# and a Mox Sapphire; on turn 2 Bot2, who has an Ornithopter, casts Obyra's Attendants (mana value 5) with a Black Lotus and two Moxen.
# Nothing triggers, and the Ornithopter is not tapped or stunned. The trigger has no legal target even if it did, so the stack
# is judged: it is empty when the Attendants has resolved.

